abstract: "A local, offline-capable application that turns NASA-ISRO NISAR Level-2 Geocoded UNWRapped Interferogram (GUNW) products into an interpretable, scientifically honest exploration experience: georeferenced phase and coherence quicklooks, quality masks, statistics, and event verification."
